# S22a, member a (k10): with b through the lobby gate and west; out by matz02 alone (a fork) at @270 s; in stag0102
# alone it leaves again by matz01 at @331 s, while b (a slow machine: DW4_ONLINE_RATE=300) still catches up to join it.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@90
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log in the field
route {route:stag0101_west}
wander -310 -190 8 until epoch>=@270
log a leaves alone
mat matz02 yes until stage=stag0102,control
log in stag0102 alone
wander 330 140 12 until epoch>=@331
log a leaves stag0102 during b's catch-up
mat matz01 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log back in stag0101
idle until frames>=600
